# The repository root ignores package-lock.json for the backend. The console is
# built on the server with `npm ci`, which requires the lockfile, so re-include
# it for this directory only.
!package-lock.json

# Private keys, certificates and keystores
# Redundant with the repository root's rules, but kept here so the directory
# stays protected if it is ever extracted into a repository of its own.
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
*.p12
*.pfx
*.p8
*.der
*.crt
*.cer
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
